   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The committee oversees coordination and logistics for the city's annual Harvest Your Energy Festival. Early meetings focused on vendor recruitment, wind turbine tours, and setting fee schedules for electronics and appliance recycling [M02#5, M03#4, M09#3]. The committee routinely evaluated festival outcomes, noting tonnage of collected materials, dehumidifiers, and electronics recycling participation [M11#5, M20#4]. Planning expanded across successive years to integrate electric vehicle showcases, shuttle bus routes, and thin-film plastic recycling demonstrations [M19#3, M25#5]. Preparations and volunteer recruitment for the festival remained an active priority through late 2026 [M28#3, M30#1].",
